sourceDesc.p:
MS untraced; text is taken from John Wood Warter (ed.), Selections from the Letters of Robert Southey, 4 vols (London, 1856) .
                    Previously published: Lucy Barton, Selections from the Poems and Letters of Bernard Barton (London, 1849), pp. 107–108 [in part];
                    and John Wood Warter (ed.), Selections from the Letters of Robert Southey, 4 vols (London, 1856), II, pp. 370–372.
